High-speed Acquisition Card:
1. Sampling and Quantization of Analog Signals;
2. Receiving and Handling data from ADC;
3. Transporting data to next work platform;

Optical Communication Receiver Card:
1. Communicating with the acquisition card;
2. Receiving and Handling data from SFP+ with protocol such as Ethernet, Aurora and so on;
3. Acting as an assistant to speed up the data processing workflow;
4. Collaborating with the server for data uplink and downlink;
